# Frontend Environment Variables
#
# For local development with Vite dev proxy, these are not needed.
# For deployed frontends (e.g. Cloudflare Pages), set VITE_API_BASE_URL
# to the Worker API URL.

# API base URL — prefix for all API requests
# Leave empty or unset for local development (Vite proxy handles routing)
# Example: https://collaborative-state-worker-sandbox.your-account.workers.dev
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
